"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Meia Maratona de Sesimbra 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no dia 21 de fevereiro de 2027 (domingo), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e chegada no Sesimbra Natura Park, concelho de Sesimbra, distrito de Set\u00fabal.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida das corridas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inicia-se \u00e0s 09h30 com a Kids Race de 500 m, seguindo-se a Meia Maratona de 21 km \u00e0s 10h00, a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 10h30 e a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 10h35.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos dorsais e kit de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A entrega decorre na sexta-feira, 19 de fevereiro (10h00 \u00e0s 20h00) nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Xistarca em Lisboa, e no s\u00e1bado, 20 de fevereiro (10h00 \u00e0s 18h00) no Sesimbra Natura Park. N\u00e3o haver\u00e1 levantamento de dorsais no dia da corrida.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existe estacionamento e balne\u00e1rios ou guarda-roupa no local?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, os participantes disp\u00f5em de estacionamento gratuito no interior do Sesimbra Natura Park e servi\u00e7o de guarda-roupa junto \u00e0 zona de partida e meta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quais os valores da Meia Maratona de Sesimbra?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma oficial da Xistarca, com valores desde 14 \u20ac (21 km), 10 \u20ac (10 km), 8 \u20ac (5 km) e 4 \u20ac (Kids Race), aumentando por fases de antecipa\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona de Sesimbra 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-21\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Sesimbra Natura Park, Sesimbra, Set\u00fabal\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sesimbra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Set\u00fabal\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\